---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
// Shell — deadpan placeholder framing. Full character bio is owner-authored content (later).
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Who the Hell Is Don Biggly? — Booze on Hormuz™"
  description="An introduction to Don Biggly, reluctantly provided by his legal team."
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="An introduction" title="Who the Hell Is Don Biggly?" />

  <section class="px-6 pb-28 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-body text-lg text-ink-soft space-y-5">
    <p>
      A full and very flattering biography is being prepared by people who are not under oath.
      It will appear here shortly.
    </p>
    <p>
      In the meantime: the receipts are gold-bound, the waters are very legal, and the shrimp
      tower has never been taller. Nobody has ever done hospitality this close to a blast radius.
      Not even close.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink-soft/80 italic">
      This page is a placeholder. Like everything else here, it is a work of satire.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
